  "details": "<p>In the\u00a0<em>Regionary Catalogues,\u00a0</em>the Forum of Nerva is included in both Regio IV as\u00a0<em>Forum Transitorium\u00a0</em>and in Regio VIII as\u00a0<em>Forum Nervae</em>.<em><br /></em></p>",
